    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Zebra Technologies Corp. describes itself as \"The World's Foundation for Intelligent Operations\" and as a provider of hardware and software for digitizing, automating, and enhancing operational processes. Its site lists mobile computers, scanners, printers, RFID, and manufacturing technology for automation, data analysis, and factory connectivity. For AI, the company names Zebra Companion AI, Zebra Frontline AI Enablers, Zebra Frontline AI Blueprints, the Zebra Aurora machine vision suite, and Zebra Aurora Focus for fixed industrial scanners and machine vision smart cameras, described as optimizing workflows, streamlining processes, and simplifying tasks.\n\nThe company is a for-profit public company headquartered in Lincolnshire, Illinois, traded under ticker ZBRA, with SEC CIK 0000877212. It is also listed under the alias Zebra Technologies Corp-CL A. Illinois litigation records list 375 entries involving the company.",
